<title>JAPAN: Japan to announce Oct-Dec GDP at 0630 GMT Thursday.</title>
<headline>Japan to announce Oct-Dec GDP at 0630 GMT Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will announce its gross domestic product (GDP) data for the October to December period on Thursday at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT), the Economic Planning Agency (EPA) said on Tuesday.</p>
